<html lang='en'><meta charset='utf-8' /><title>VTubeLeaf Rust dependency licenses</title>
  <h1>Rust dependency licenses</h1>
  <p>Generated by cargo-about 0.9.2 from Cargo.lock. Includes build dependencies and all platforms,
    so some listed crates are not present in a particular binary. MPL-2.0 crate source is available
    from the linked exact-version registry pages; VTubeLeaf does not modify those crates.</p>
  {{#each licenses}}
    <h2>{{name}}</h2><ul>{{#each used_by}}<li><a
            href='https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}'
          >{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>{{/each}}</ul>
    <pre style='white-space:pre-wrap'>{{text}}</pre>
  {{/each}}
</html>